From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Share original audio source state and lifetime steps
Upstream-base: 443164c91fded218656a8443432e642fdad57838

Share original resident source prepare/play/update/stop/public-state transitions
and backend initialize/publish/remove/destroy ordering through typed adapters.
Console adapters retain AX address, state and interrupt operations. Native
one-shot output supplies real SDL ownership without selecting backend startup,
streaming, loop addresses, controller speakers or aux effects.

